              "content": "BRAND · THE MARK",
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": 1.3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "QO7pf",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$fg-default",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Stockerly logo",
              "fontFamily": "$font-display",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": -0.6
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "j0ZW3",
              "name": "Intro",
              "fill": "$fg-subtle",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The mark's mechanics: construction, optical sizing, clear space, correct and incorrect uses, and applications (favicon, app icon, PWA, chrome). NOT the identity — D1 fixed palette and type and this sheet moves neither. Outcome: the four-bracket focal frame is replaced by a counterform disc with two carved candles (D45); the kit ships it at 0.7.0.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "id": "eef0T",
          "name": "Rule",
          "fill": "$border-default",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Y6omth",
          "name": "Hallazgos",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": "$space-4",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "d24kLj",
              "name": "Section",
              "fill": "$fg-subtle",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "FINDINGS — AND WHERE EACH ONE STANDS",
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": 1.3
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "E9O1x",
              "name": "1 · Ci",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$space-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fZuOE",
                  "name": "Label",
                  "fill": "$fg-default",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1 · Five constructions of the same mark — RESOLVED",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "AUWqq",
                  "name": "Body",
                  "fill": "$fg-subtle",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "glyph.svg (stroke 5) · glyph_thick.svg (8) · wordmark.svg (7) · logo_light/dark.svg (7) · public/*.svg (6). Four stroke weights for one symbol and no single source they derived from. There is now one canonical geometry, specified in the Símbolo sheet.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "FvhTX",
              "name": "2 · El",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$space-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eCDIY",
                  "name": "Label",
                  "fill": "$fg-default",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "2 · The symbol did not survive 16 px — RESOLVED",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ltEH2",
                  "name": "Body",
                  "fill": "$fg-subtle",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Brackets sat 15.6% from the edge at 6/64 weight: at 16 px that is four 1.5 px marks separated from each other, plus a 2.5 px dot. Four viewfinder-plus-content variants were built and all four died below 32 px. The counterform fixes it structurally — a stroke thins as it shrinks, a void does not.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "S6Vh6T",
              "name": "3 · 🐞",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$space-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Kkqpm",
                  "name": "Label",
                  "fill": "$fg-default",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "3 · 🐞 The maskable icon is mis-built — DESIGNED, NOT SHIPPED",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UgMm2",
                  "name": "Body",
                  "fill": "$fg-subtle",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "manifest.json declares icon-512.svg as purpose:maskable but serves the same artwork as the 'any' icon. A maskable's safe zone is the centre circle at 66.6%; the brackets lived in the corners, exactly what the launcher crops. The PWA sheet draws a separate maskable at 52%. The code change is still open.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "cnv56",
              "name": "4 · 🐞",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$space-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "i7Kfu",
                  "name": "Label",
                  "fill": "$fg-default",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "4 · 🐞 1.0 copy in the manifest — DESIGNED, NOT SHIPPED",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YIprP",
                  "name": "Body",
                  "fill": "$fg-subtle",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "«Navigate the Markets with Confidence» and «Open Source Market Intelligence Platform»: multi-user marketing, in English, in a single-user self-hosted tracker whose UI is es-MX. It is what you read when installing the PWA, so it is product copy. Replacement drafted in the PWA sheet.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "seo0C",
              "name": "5 · El",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$space-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "q5wbsb",
                  "name": "Label",
                  "fill": "$fg-default",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "5 · The ?v=2 cache bust lives in two files — OPEN",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "oDdxQ",
                  "name": "Body",
                  "fill": "$fg-subtle",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "application.html.erb (4 links) and manifest.json (4 icons). Changing the artwork and bumping only half leaves stale icons served indefinitely. Both must go to ?v=3 in the same commit.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
